      "ArticleTitle": "Interaction of octahedral ruthenium(II) polypyridyl complex [Ru(bpy)2(PIP)]2+ with poly(U)·poly(A)*poly(U) triplex: Increasing third-strand stabilization of the triplex without affecting the stability of the duplex.",
